MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: e6cb25f3c1035093882f8e2fd756ed70, type: 3}
  m_Name: Dialogue_Warden
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Game.Data::EndlessDescent.Data.DialogueDefinition
  id: dialogue.npc.ashmere.1
  rootId: root
  lines:
  - Id: root
    Text: '{npc} of the Gravewardens. She is counting something and does not stop
      to talk.'
    Requires: []
    Choices:
    - Text: What do the Wardens want here?
      GoTo: rites
      Requires: []
      Effects: []
      Action: 0
      QuestId: 
    - Text: Is there work?
      GoTo: fee
      Requires:
      - Kind: 9
        Faction: {fileID: 0}
        Item: {fileID: 0}
        Npc: {fileID: 0}
        QuestId: quest.act1.wardens
        Amount: 0
        FromHour: 0
        ToHour: 23
      - Kind: 3
        Faction: {fileID: 0}
        Item: {fileID: 0}
        Npc: {fileID: 0}
        QuestId: quest.act1.wardens
        Amount: 0
        FromHour: 0
        ToHour: 23
      Effects: []
      Action: 1
      QuestId: quest.act1.wardens
    - Text: About the fee.
      GoTo: settled
      Requires:
      - Kind: 8
        Faction: {fileID: 0}
        Item: {fileID: 0}
        Npc: {fileID: 0}
        QuestId: quest.act1.wardens
        Amount: 0
        FromHour: 0
        ToHour: 23
      Effects: []
      Action: 2
      QuestId: 
    - Text: We are on good terms, then.
      GoTo: friend
      Requires:
      - Kind: 0
        Faction: {fileID: 11400000, guid: fba0a8fe9beb89c1f88b8c0dd2a76d54, type: 2}
        Item: {fileID: 0}
        Npc: {fileID: 0}
        QuestId: 
        Amount: 25
        FromHour: 0
        ToHour: 23
      Effects: []
      Action: 0
      QuestId: 
    - Text: I will leave you to it.
      GoTo: 
      Requires: []
      Effects: []
      Action: 4
      QuestId: 
  - Id: rites
    Text: What we always want. The rites said, the fee paid, and the parish to stop
      pretending those are the same thing.
    Requires: []
    Choices:
    - Text: And if they are not paid?
      GoTo: unpaid
      Requires: []
      Effects: []
      Action: 0
      QuestId: 
  - Id: unpaid
    Text: Then the dead stay where they fell and we are blamed for it.
    Requires: []
    Choices:
    - Text: I see.
      GoTo: root
      Requires: []
      Effects: []
      Action: 0
      QuestId: 
  - Id: fee
    Text: Sixty. In my hand, not on the ledger. You will understand why before long.
    Requires: []
    Choices:
    - Text: Sixty it is.
      GoTo: root
      Requires: []
      Effects: []
      Action: 0
      QuestId: 
  - Id: settled
    Text: Paid twice and recorded once. Do not put that together out loud in here.
    Requires: []
    Choices:
    - Text: Noted.
      GoTo: root
      Requires: []
      Effects: []
      Action: 0
      QuestId: 
  - Id: friend
    Text: 'We are. Which is why I will say it plainly: the clerk''s brother is on
      that register, and he wrote the entry himself.'
    Requires: []
    Choices:
    - Text: Before or after?
      GoTo: root
      Requires: []
      Effects: []
      Action: 0
      QuestId: 
